+		/* F-199 (T-M7-2 S4): offload TX FQ with NO TX confirmation.
+		 * context_a = vendor-proven no-TX-confirm value 0x9a000000c0000000
+		 * (NXP SDK sdk_dpaa FQ_FLAG_NO_TXCONFIRM; devman.c hi=0x9a000000
